# CODEOWNERS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Defines who is automatically requested for review when a pull request
# touches matching paths. When "Require review from Code Owners" is enabled
# on the protected `main` branch, at least one owner below must approve.
#
# Rules (last matching pattern wins):
#   *  = every file      @handle = GitHub username or @org/team
#
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Default owner for the whole repository
*                       @meetr1912

# CI, automation, and dev environment
/.github/               @meetr1912
/.devcontainer/         @meetr1912

# Application source and tests
/src/                   @meetr1912
/tests/                 @meetr1912

# Documentation
*.md                    @meetr1912

# Repository metadata
/CODEOWNERS             @meetr1912
/LICENSE                @meetr1912
